        "original_id": "622c1a67-0c73-5d33-9ff1-f47b60990ded",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Groups: JJ Project, Got7\n- People: JB, Jinyoung, Mark, Jackson, Youngjae, BamBam, Yugyeom\n- Companies: JYP Entertainment\n- Products: \"Bounce\", \"Got It?\", Verse 2\n- Places: South Korea\n- Concepts: pop duo, boy group, extended play\n\nFacts:\n- JJ Project is a South Korean pop duo consisting of JB and Jinyoung.\n- JYP Entertainment formed JJ Project, and JJ Project released its first single, \"Bounce,\" in May 2012.\n- Got7 is a South Korean boy group formed by JYP Entertainment.\n- Got7 is composed of seven members: JB, Mark, Jackson, Jinyoung, Youngjae, BamBam, and Yugyeom.\n- Got7 debuted in January 2014 with its first EP, \"Got It?\"\n- \"Got It?\" peaked at number two on the Gaon Album Chart and number one on Billboard's World Albums Chart.\n- Verse 2 is the first extended play by South Korean male duo JJ Project.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
